  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39062556",
      "title": "Disabling the Code Editor for Specific Parts of the Task",
      "sourceHash": "4507e89da33e458e6b90564e5bffff0cd510b22de5032df463ffbe078ad9fa3b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.41,
          "en": "Now when doing prompt engineering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.41,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "for ChatGPT when using Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 12.54,
          "en": "there's one very useful special technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.54,
          "end": 17.16,
          "en": "that only applies when using this Code Interpreter feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.16,
          "end": 19.02,
          "en": "you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.02,
          "end": 22.56,
          "en": "Let's say we have a file with some text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.56,
          "end": 25.593,
          "en": "that we want ChatGPT to summarize.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 30.09,
          "en": "For that we can of course upload this text file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.09,
          "end": 32.97,
          "en": "and we could then tell ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 35.643,
          "en": "to summarize the text in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 39.66,
          "en": "Now the problem with this prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 44.66,
          "en": "is that ChatGPT might try to write some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.91,
          "end": 47.79,
          "en": "that tries to summarize the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.79,
          "end": 52.35,
          "en": "But since ChatGPT itself is actually pretty decent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "at summarizing texts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 58.8,
          "en": "we instead might prefer to get ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.8,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "to just write and execute code for opening the text file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 68.69,
          "en": "but we don't want ChatGPT to use Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 68.88,
          "end": 71.01,
          "en": "for summarizing the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 71.01,
          "end": 74.7,
          "en": "Instead, that should be done by ChatGPT itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.7,
          "end": 77.61,
          "en": "We could therefore enhance this prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.61,
          "end": 80.64,
          "en": "by adding some extra context to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.64,
          "end": 82.66,
          "en": "For example, here I'm telling ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "that it should summarize this text file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "but that it should only write and execute Python code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 94.64,
          "en": "for opening the file and that it should produce the summary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 98.16,
          "en": "without writing or executing any code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 100.38,
          "en": "that it should instead summarize the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.38,
          "end": 102.53999999999999,
          "en": "on its own basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 102.53999999999999,
          "end": 107.37,
          "en": "And with that, we should ensure that indeed ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.37,
          "end": 110.31,
          "en": "does not try to generate some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 112.41,
          "en": "that tries to do the summary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 115.89,
          "en": "but that instead it only uses and executes code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.89,
          "end": 119.78999999999999,
          "en": "for opening the file and getting access to its content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 119.78999999999999,
          "end": 123.48,
          "en": "and that it then provides a summary of the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 125.94,
          "en": "in that file on its own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.94,
          "end": 129.75,
          "en": "just as it would do it without Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.75,
          "end": 132.27,
          "en": "if we would just give it some raw text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.27,
          "end": 134.4,
          "en": "that it should summarize.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.4,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "And this is therefore another pretty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 139.82999999999998,
          "en": "useful prompting technique you should be aware of,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.82999999999998,
          "end": 144.82999999999998,
          "en": "because sometimes you might want that raw ChatGPT behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.92000000000002,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "without it using Code Interpreter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 151.473,
          "en": "at least not for all parts of the task.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
